{"id":"9f386ed894f9278c","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-set9-closed-under-union.md","title":"ZFC Set9 Closed Under Union","display":"df-zfc-set9-closed-under-union — ZFC Set9 Closed Under Union","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set9-closed-under-union","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set9-closed-under-union"],"display":"df-zfc-set9-closed-under-union — ZFC Set9 Closed Under Union","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-ax-union]]","[[58-df-union]]","[[58-df-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set9-closed-under-union"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set9-closed-under-union</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set9-closed-under-union — ZFC Set9 Closed Under Union"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b56ca7a92384a70a\" href=\"?note=b56ca7a92384a70a\" title=\"58-ax-union\">58-ax-union</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a295a90caf70085\" href=\"?note=5a295a90caf70085\" title=\"58-df-union\">58-df-union</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> (definable-class parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span> (definable-class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9ClosedUnderUnion}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet9ClosedUnderUnion}_S\\)</span> (unary class predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}closed\\text{-}under\\text{-}union} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet9ClosedUnderUnion}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land \\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(x\\in C\\to \\bigcup x\\in C\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}closed\\text{-}under\\text{-}union} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet9ClosedUnderUnion}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land \\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(x\\in C\\to \\bigcup x\\in C\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The argument may be a proper definable class, so closure is expressed by a class-schema formula over set variables.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-union","status":"resolved","id":"b56ca7a92384a70a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-union]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-union","status":"resolved","id":"5a295a90caf70085","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-union]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9